<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 853)</h2>
<ul>
<li>A clip you don&#8217;t have streams as the same encrypted review copy a browser gets &#8212; now for image sequences and stills too. The orange PROXY tag says so; ask for a higher-resolution clip when you need the original.</li>
<li>The invitation sheet wears the same design as the other review windows, and says whether the invite works from anywhere.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
